uctions", "contents": [{"content": "Talking about rolling the dice!", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn11le16ob10re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1, "id": 0, "selected": 0}], "id": 0}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"title": "", "id": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn11le16ob10re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn11le16ob10re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn11le16ob10re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn11le16ob10re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: Hey, Vanessa!\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hi, Bill. Sorry.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: You must not have gotten much sleep last night - you look tired.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Lots to think about. What do you have there, Bill?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: Two tickets to paradise.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: More to think about. Listen, Bill. This might not be a good idea.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: I shouldn't have waited as long as I did to ask you out, but if I had asked you earlier, would you have said yes?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Bill, I don't know. I might have done that. Yes.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: Well, I'm asking you now. Here is the ticket.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No, I can't. I can't take that."}, {"time": "40000", "image": "engenn11le16ob10re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>:  Here is the ticket.  The departure time is on it. I'll wait for you at a pub called O'Malley's. I'll wait for you up until boarding time, but I won't wait a second more. I'm going and I would like you to come with me.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Why?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>:  My father and I didn't have a good relationship. He could have helped me with my homework, he could've played games with me, but what he would do is give great pearls of wisdom from time to time. One day, unanticipatedly, he said, \u201cSon, in life. You have to know when to roll the dice.\u201d I don't know why, but that has always stayed with me and for whatever reason, so far in my life I've known when to roll the dice. I knew when to do it when investing, I took a chance on hiring you and look how that worked out for me.  And now, I'm rolling the dice on you again.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:   Bill, who is going to run the place?"}, {"time": "97000", "image": "engenn11le16ob10re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: I already talked to the partners. They are going to take care of everything.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Bill, those guys are inexperienced and careless. We both know this.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: You're stalling now. I'll see you Friday. Is that your friend Peter over there?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: He looks content.</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: So what happened?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: He gave me a ticket to the Maldives.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Wow! Are you going to go?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No!"}]}}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}